[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413169682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111723#issuecomment-3413169682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111723","id":3413169682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LcNYS","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-16T22:58:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T22:58:42Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.6.dev 60710df3b (Linux).\n\n> Godot v4.6.dev (60710df3b) - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.95.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\nI've toggled SDFGI off and back on before each screenshot to make sure it's up-to-date.\n\n### 0, 0, 0\n\nDebug cascades | Debug probes\n-|-\n<img width=\"1791\" height=\"997\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1cfa84a0-08f1-4c5c-b241-c764dcf38e93\" /> | <img width=\"1910\" height=\"1002\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73e2a33d-e48b-4e9e-a3a7-e2dc91d9d448\" />\n\n### 0, 200, 0\n\nDebug cascades | Debug probes\n-|-\n<img width=\"1791\" height=\"997\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c81db1a4-8cb0-4c24-90a1-71f0e33ee37e\" /> | <img width=\"1791\" height=\"997\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2ffd3d6-ac4f-474f-884e-0f9b14e1fd28\" />\n\nMoving the StaticBody3D by ±200 units on other axes works. It's only broken on the Y axis (positive or negative). Moving the StaticBody3D by 200 units on the Y axis *and* another axis also looks broken.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413169682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415577866","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111723#issuecomment-3415577866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111723","id":3415577866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LlZUK","user":{"login":"myersguy","id":16710806,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzEwODA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16710806?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy","html_url":"https://github.com/myersguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myersguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T13:13:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T13:13:43Z","body":"<img width=\"374\" height=\"188\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b631c92f-0398-4ab0-a599-a1c9c06d1be9\" />\n\nEnabling Y-Scale 100% _seems_ to fix this. I'm not sure if this is necessarily the intended use case, however.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415577866/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3439071664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111723#issuecomment-3439071664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111723","id":3439071664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7M_BGw","user":{"login":"zuedev","id":24614929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjE0OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24614929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev","html_url":"https://github.com/zuedev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zuedev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T20:42:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T20:42:13Z","body":"In [`servers\\rendering\\renderer_rd\\environment\\gi.cpp`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a4607f4/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/gi.cpp#L1930-L1932):\n\nSDFGI cascade positions are stored in Y-scaled grid space, where world positions have been transformed by multiplying Y by y_mult. When converting these positions back to world space for bounds checking, the inverse transform (* Vector3(1, 1.0 / y_mult, 1)) must be applied.\n\nThe cascade_aabb construction in pre_process_gi() is missing this inverse transform, causing it to compare bounds in Y-scaled grid space against light_aabb in world space. This results in incorrect culling of dynamic lights at high/low Y positions when using non-100% Y scale.\n\nI have opened a [PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111968) to fix this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3439071664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]